    <div class="content-section">
        <p>The cell dynamic analysis shows that SOFC stacks themselves have promising potential for commercial building applications as the electric power settling time is consistently faster than 6 minutes which is well within the hourly timestep of dynamic operation in current optimization studies. The analysis has also shown that maintaining constant flow rates throughout current transients generally increases settling time and does not improve the dynamic response of the stack due to the increased flow rates.</p>
    </div>

